{"title": "Ruintamer Heart", "pageid": 28261, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ruintamer_Heart", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Ruintamer Heart</b> is a passive feature that enhances your rage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raging\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\">Raging</a>, the wearer generates 2 turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\">Wrath</a>.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enraging_Heart_Garb\" title=\"Enraging Heart Garb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Enraging_Heart_Garb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Enraging_Heart_Garb\" title=\"Enraging Heart Garb\">Enraging Heart Garb</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Ruintamer Heart has no effect, and does not function in-game.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203633\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\